# Publish ONLY the static web prototype (web/) plus repo metadata. Everything else in this folder stays local:
# raw data (data/, external_data/), analysis code and outputs (src/, outputs/, docs/, tests/), notebooks, configs.
# Whitelist approach: ignore everything at the top level, then re-include what the public repo needs.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/.github/
!/web/

# never publish local caches or editor files, even inside web/
**/__pycache__/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
web/**/*.tmp
